# Files Prettier must not rewrite.
#
# The syntax is the same as .gitignore: one glob per line, "#" starts a comment.
# Prettier also reads .gitignore, but relying on that would silently change what is formatted the
# moment someone edits .gitignore for an unrelated reason, so the list is repeated here on purpose.

# Installed packages and build output: not ours to format, and enormous.
node_modules/
dist/

# pnpm's local package store. It exists because the project is bind-mounted into a container, which
# pushes pnpm off its default store location.
.pnpm-store/

# The dependency lockfile. It is generated by pnpm, in pnpm's own formatting, and reformatting it
# would produce a huge diff that the next `pnpm install` immediately undoes.
pnpm-lock.yaml
